===Etymology 1===
From {{etyl|ofs|fy}} {{m|ofs|rīke}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|fy}} {{m|gem-pro|*rīkiją||realm}}, from {{etyl|cel-pro|fy}} {{m|cel-pro|*rīgiom||kingdom}}, from {{m|cel-pro|*rīxs||king}} (compare Irish {{m|ga|rí}}), from {{etyl|ine-pro|fy}} {{m|ine-pro|*h₃rḗǵs||king}}. Cognates include Dutch {{m|nl|rijk}}, obsolete English {{m|en|riche}}, German {{m|de|Reich}}, Danish {{m|da|rige}}.

